# VLXBLK extension: vector indexed block loads (one index per block of
# 2**blk_log2 elements; blocks packed contiguously in the destination).
# custom-1 opcode space (0x2B), coexisting with Xdma (funct7 0x00-0x07).
#   funct7 0x0C = vlxblk indexed block load (funct3 = index EEW: 0=EI8, 5=EI16)
#   funct7 0x0D = vsxblk indexed block store (funct3 = index EEW: 0=EI8, 5=EI16)
#     unordered semantics (vsuxei-like); vs3 (store data) in the vd field
#   funct7 0x0F = vsetblklen (set block length in elements from rs1)
vlxblkei8.v   vd rs1 vs2 31..25=0x0C 14..12=0x0 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3
vlxblkei16.v  vd rs1 vs2 31..25=0x0C 14..12=0x5 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3
vsxblkei8.v   vd rs1 vs2 31..25=0x0D 14..12=0x0 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3
vsxblkei16.v  vd rs1 vs2 31..25=0x0D 14..12=0x5 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3
vsetblklen    rs1 31..25=0x0F 24..20=0 14..12=0x0 11..7=0 6..2=0x0A 1..0=3
